om2
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note seed/ng/src/ir.om: ΩIR in memory (seed/ng/IR.md s14), its builder, and the one binary reader
note and writer of the ng compiler. Owner: ng-ir lane. First unit of seed/ng/ng.units; no fn main.
note Names: functions ir_*, globals i_* (D1b). Other lanes read the i_* tables and call ir_*; they
note never write a table directly. Handles are uint, 0 = none, numbered from 1 in creation order.
note
note Row table: one line per op, "OP NAME TK IMM FIX VAR TY" (IR.md s7.12). TK 0 P, 1 E, 2 R, 3 T.
note TY 0 always 0, 1 result type, 2 optional result, 3 parameter (no result value).
text i_rows "1 const 0 1 0 0 1\n2 select 0 0 3 0 1\n10 add 0 0 2 0 1\n11 sub 0 0 2 0 1\n12 mul 0 0 2 0 1\n13 div 0 0 2 0 1\n14 rem 0 0 2 0 1\n15 neg 0 0 1 0 1\n16 and 0 0 2 0 1\n17 or 0 0 2 0 1\n18 xor 0 0 2 0 1\n19 not 0 0 1 0 1\n20 shl 0 0 2 0 1\n21 shr 0 0 2 0 1\n22 rotl 0 0 2 0 1\n23 rotr 0 0 2 0 1\n24 min 0 0 2 0 1\n25 max 0 0 2 0 1\n26 fsqrt 0 0 1 0 1\n27 fabs 0 0 1 0 1\n28 fmath 0 1 1 0 1\n30 eq 0 0 2 0 1\n31 ne 0 0 2 0 1\n32 lt 0 0 2 0 1\n33 le 0 0 2 0 1\n34 gt 0 0 2 0 1\n35 ge 0 0 2 0 1\n36 conv 0 1 1 0 1\n37 bitcast 0 0 1 0 1\n40 gpu.id 0 1 0 0 1\n41 shared 0 0 0 0 1\n42 load 2 0 2 0 1\n43 store 1 0 3 0 0\n44 sync 1 0 0 0 0\n45 shfl 0 1 2 0 1\n46 fma 0 0 3 0 1\n47 atom 1 1 3 0 1\n48 atomcas 1 1 4 0 1\n50 alloca 1 0 0 0 1\n51 fill 1 0 2 0 0\n52 gaddr 0 1 0 0 1\n53 len 0 0 1 0 1\n54 slice 2 0 3 0 1\n55 fload 2 1 1 0 1\n56 fstore 1 1 2 0 0\n57 fref 0 1 1 0 1\n58 vload 2 0 2 0 1\n59 vstore 1 0 3 0 0\n60 br 3 0 1 1 0\n61 cbr 3 0 3 0 0\n62 ret 3 0 0 0 0\n63 retv 3 0 1 0 0\n64 call 1 0 1 1 2\n65 trap 3 1 0 0 0\n66 exit 3 0 1 0 0\n67 launch 1 0 4 1 0\n70 chk.add 1 1 2 0 0\n71 chk.sub 1 1 2 0 0\n72 chk.mul 1 1 2 0 0\n73 chk.neg 1 1 1 0 0\n74 chk.divz 1 1 1 0 0\n75 chk.divovf 1 1 2 0 0\n76 chk.shl 1 1 2 0 0\n77 chk.shift 1 1 1 0 0\n78 chk.conv 1 1 1 0 3\n79 chk.bounds 1 1 3 0 0\n80 chk.slice 1 1 3 0 0\n81 chk.fuel 1 1 2 0 0\n82 chk.true 1 1 1 0 0\n90 fact.true 0 1 1 0 0\n91 fact.range 0 1 3 0 0\n92 fact.inbounds 0 1 3 0 0\n93 fact.slice 0 1 3 0 0\n100 vsplat 0 0 1 0 1\n101 vextract 0 1 1 0 1\n102 vinsert 0 1 2 0 1\n103 vreduce 0 1 1 0 1\n104 mmald 2 1 4 0 1\n105 mmast 1 1 5 0 0\n106 mma 0 1 3 0 1\n110 host 1 1 0 1 2\n111 pool.grow 1 1 1 0 1\n112 pool.len 2 1 0 0 1\n113 pool.load 2 1 1 0 1\n114 pool.store 1 1 2 0 0\n115 pool.read 1 1 3 0 1\n116 pool.write 1 1 3 0 1\n"
text i_magic "OSC1IR"
text i_tag "omega.ng.ir.v1"
text i_tag2 "omega.ng.ir.v2"
text i_semtag "omega.ng.sem.fn.v2"
global i_rok uchar 256
global i_rtk uchar 256
global i_rim uchar 256
global i_rfx uchar 256
global i_rvr uchar 256
global i_rty uchar 256
global i_rno uint 256
global i_rnl uchar 256
global i_rp ulong 1
