note ar_init: every region but the payload gets its first room after it: hash buckets 1024
note (fnhash, lnamehash, longhash, namehash), the output 65536 bytes, every other group 64 entries
fn ar_init to void
ar_defs
z = ar_need 1 65535
z = ar_need 2 63
z = ar_need 3 63
z = ar_need 4 63
z = ar_need 5 1023
z = ar_need 6 63
z = ar_need 7 1023
z = ar_need 8 63
