end
ir_wn get i_n 3 4
for i ulong get i_n 3 bound 65536
ir_wfn uint add i 1
end
ret get i_on 0
end
note ---- binary reader ------------------------------------------------------------------------
note refusal: the first class sticks, with the cursor offset (or at, when given)
fn ir_bad c ulong ofs ulong to void
